{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"promoted":1,"teasers":40},[2,15,26],{"title":3,"employer":4,"tags":5,"image":9,"alt":3,"released":10,"promoted":11,"slug":12,"content":13,"canonical":14},"Lego Boost","noprotocol",[6,7,8],"vue","video","rxjs","lego-boost.png","",1,"top1","\u003Cp>Verreweg het leukste project ooit. Een campagne site waarbij je zelf blokken in een timeline kon slepen om zodoende de LEGO Boost robot te programmeren.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>Een leuke uitdaging met o.a. multi-touch drag-and-drop en video&#39;s die soepel en met geluid in willekeurige volgorde worden afgespeeld.\u003C/p>\n","lego-boost",{"title":16,"employer":17,"tags":18,"image":21,"released":10,"promoted":22,"slug":23,"content":24,"canonical":25},"Smart Clock","open source",[19,20],"golang","sdl2","smart-clock.png",2,"top2","\u003Cp>\u003Ca href=\"https://github.com/bfanger/clock\">Smart Clock\u003C/a> is een app die ik voor ons gezin heb gemaakt. Deze draait in de woonkamer op een Raspberry Pi met een \u003Ca href=\"https://shop.pimoroni.com/products/hyperpixel-4\">4.0 inch scherm\u003C/a> naast de TV.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>Naast dat deze de tijd weergeeft met analoge wijzers, zodat mijn zoontje (en ik) beter leerde klokkijken is de klok door de jaren heen verder uitgebreid met nuttige informatie zoals:\u003C/p>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>Timer die aftelt voordat school begint, met tijden uit \u003Ca href=\"https://magister.nl/\">Magister\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Welke afvalbak er aan de straat gezet moet worden obv de \u003Ca href=\"https://www.hvcgroep.nl/afval/afvalkalender\">HVC afvalkalender\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Het volume van mijn Sonos Ray soundbar\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Is er het aankomende uur regen voorspeld vanuit \u003Ca href=\"https://www.buienradar.nl/\">Buienradar\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>en meer...\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n","smart-clock",{"title":27,"employer":28,"released":10,"image":29,"alt":27,"tags":30,"promoted":36,"slug":37,"content":38,"canonical":39},"NLZIET","triple","nlziet.png",[31,32,8,33,34,35],"svelte","typescript","smarttv","bitmovin","shaka-player",3,"top3","\u003Cp>\u003Ca href=\"https://www.nlziet.nl/\">NLZIET\u003C/a> is een alternatief voor kabeltelevisie, maar naast live tv kijken biedt deze dienst ook extra features zoals terugkijken of reclamevrij kijken.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>Wij hebben voor NLZIET de SmartTV app ontwikkeld, deze maakt gebruik van het Mauna Framework dat we bij Triple ontwikkeld hebben.\u003C/p>\n","nlziet",[41,47,53,59,65,71,77,82,88,94,100,106,112,118,124,130,136,142,148,154,160,166,172,178,182,188,194,199,204,210,216,222,228,234,240,246,252,258,264,268,272,277,282,286,292,297,303,307,313,319,324,329,335,341,347,351,357,363,369,375,378,384,390,396,401,407,412,416,422,428,432,438,444,450,456,462,466,472,478,484,490,494,500,506,512,518,524,530,536,542,548,554,560,566,570,576,582,588,594,599,604,610,616,622,628,634,639,644,649,654,659,664,669,674,679,684,689,695,700,705,710,715,721,726,731,736,741,747,753,759,764,769,775,780,784,789,794,800,806,812,818],{"slug":42,"title":43,"released":44,"thumbnail":45,"aspect":46},"slopcorp","SlopCorp","2026-10-05","/build/thumbnails/slopcorp.jpg","1820/1556",{"slug":48,"title":49,"released":50,"thumbnail":51,"aspect":52},"agent-container","Agent Container","2026-06","/build/thumbnails/agent-container.jpg","386/359",{"slug":54,"title":55,"released":56,"thumbnail":57,"aspect":58},"poppenkast-3d","Virtuele Poppenkast","2026-03-01","/build/thumbnails/poppenkast.jpg","1520/797",{"slug":60,"title":61,"released":62,"thumbnail":63,"aspect":64},"dice-game-update","Dice Game 2.0","2026-02-05","/build/thumbnails/dice-game-update.jpg","2046/1348",{"slug":66,"title":67,"released":68,"thumbnail":69,"aspect":70},"this-nl","Nieuwe huisstijl voor this.nl","2026-01","/build/thumbnails/this.nl.jpg","2642/1890",{"slug":72,"title":73,"released":74,"thumbnail":75,"aspect":76},"this-portfolio","Portfolio website van This is Creative","2025-11","/build/thumbnails/thi